\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mstyle><mo>,</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">)</mo></mrow><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div></div>",
